cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, models, or benchmark suite in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "LiteCascade: A Lightweight Early-Exit Cascade for IoT Malware and Intrusion Detection"
abstract: "LiteCascade is a resource-efficient early-exit neural cascade for edge IoT network intrusion and malware detection. It couples a sub-10K parameter INT8 Sentinel detector with a full-capacity Analyst model via risk-controlled temperature-scaled confidence thresholds, achieving 2.64x empirical speedup and 97.4% Macro-F1 on microcontroller and edge gateway platforms."
